<overview>
<p>The Armed Forces of the Federated Suns integrate conventional infantry directly into their Regimental Combat Teams, assigning foot, mechanized, and jump platoons to work permanently alongside BattleMech and armored formations. Towing LB-X autocannon that can fire cluster munitions to spread damage across a wider area, these field gun crews provide flexible direct fire that adapts to both concentrated and dispersed targets.</p>
</overview>

<notes>
Intro date based on production date of AFFS 3067+ advanced infantry kit.  Federated Long Rifle is the classic long arm of the AFFS.
</notes>

